{"4065350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project Hash", "steam_appid": 4065350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the future world, the tech giant Hash Corporation holds the energy technology that can change the fate of humanity—the Hash Heritage. However, these heritages are not just symbols of energy; they hide dangers and secrets. You are trapped in a massive facility composed of mysterious substances and high-tech devices, with the sole goal: to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a battle, but a test of wisdom and courage. You must utilize the characteristics of energy blocks, solve puzzles, avoid traps, and find the exit.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the future world, the tech giant Hash Corporation holds the energy technology that can change the fate of humanity—the Hash Heritage. However, these heritages are not just symbols of energy; they hide dangers and secrets. You are trapped in a massive facility composed of mysterious substances and high-tech devices, with the sole goal: to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a battle, but a test of wisdom and courage. You must utilize the characteristics of energy blocks, solve puzzles, avoid traps, and find the exit.</p>", "short_description": "You play as an explorer in Hash Company’s high-tech world: master diverse energy blocks to escape, use lasers for transmission or teleportation, traverse terrain with teleport blocks, and build energy networks with receivers and refractors for creative puzzle-solving.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065350/4da7603d6b4fd5abe34624f1200054994b6cd3bd/header.jpg?t=1763045655", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065350/0e8aa1fb5183db79494ae5ab79c399bc0bff35f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763045655", "capsule_imagev5":